@base = https://sis-ca.com.mx:7863/carobra-api/index.php/api

### Login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clave": "MATNAHORT",
  "contrasena": "DzVuYd*-53"
}

### Buscar folio
GET {{base}}/buscar-folio?q=8080

### Buscar NAP
GET {{base}}/buscar-nap?q=1112

### Buscar comisionista
GET {{base}}/buscar-comisionista?q=garcia

### Afores
GET {{base}}/afores

### Guardar traspaso
POST {{base}}/guardar-traspaso
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folio": "8080398430",
  "no_empleado": "123",
  "afo_cedente": "SURA",
  "acompanamiento": "0.00"
}

